      '**Oilseeds:** groundnut, rapeseed and mustard, soybean, sunflower. **Fibre crops:** **cotton** (black soils of the Deccan; Gujarat, Maharashtra, Telangana), **jute** (West Bengal, Assam, Bihar).',
